{"statement": "As ResponsibilityAgent, I assert that ethical compliance is critical for the RollCall system. RES-01 ensures adherence to data protection regulations, safeguarding student privacy. RES-02 promotes transparency in attendance recording, fostering accountability. RES-03 allows students to dispute records, ensuring fairness, while RES-04 protects identities in reports. RES-05 notifies students of their status, enhancing communication, and RES-06 restricts access to authorized personnel, maintaining security. RES-07 ensures compliance with educational regulations on data retention. Together, these requirements uphold the ethical responsibility of the system, promoting trust and integrity in attendance management.",
